          uummoouunntt.._s_u_f_f_i_x {_d_i_r_e_c_t_o_r_y|_d_e_v_i_c_e} [--ffllnnrrvv] [--NN _n_a_m_e_s_p_a_c_e] [--tt
          _t_y_p_e._s_u_b_t_y_p_e]

       where _s_u_f_f_i_x is the filesystem type (or the value from a uuhheellppeerr== or
       hheellppeerr== marker in the mtab file). The --tt option can be used for
